{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26524","headline":"山出云 · 张复","name":"山出云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山静云初吐，霏微触石新。\n无心离碧岫，有叶占青春。\n散类如虹气，轻同不让尘。\n凌空还似翼，映涧欲成鳞。\n异起临汾鼎，疑随出峡神。\n爲霖终济旱，非独降贤人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}